<title>USA: Sonic to buy back up to 9.9 pct of stock.</title>
<headline>Sonic to buy back up to 9.9 pct of stock.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sonic Corp said Monday it will repurchase up to 1.3 million shares, which would be 9.9 percent of its outstanding stock.</p>
<p>The purchases will be made from time to time on the open market, financed with internal funds and available bank credit facilities, the company said.</p>
<p>Sonic shares closed Friday at 13-5/8. Their 52-week high is 26-3/8.</p>
</text>
